# Hardened Scales applies to +1/+1 counters put on "a creature you control" (CR 614.1a, 122.6); Ozolith, the Shattered Spire to
# those put on "an artifact or creature you control". Ozolith's ability puts one counter on Bot1's Sol Ring, an artifact that is
# no creature: only Ozolith applies, so it gets 1 + 1 = 2. Two turns later it puts one on Bot1's Ornithopter, an artifact
# creature: both apply, each once (CR 614.5), and it gets 1 + 1 + 1 = 3, whichever Bot1 has apply first (CR 616.1).

